sequenceDiagram
title Critical User Case 2: Obtain Recommendations
   actor User
   box Museum Recommendation System
       participant WebApp
       participant Recommender
       participant UserDatabase
       participant MuseumDatabase
   end


   User->>WebApp: User opens app and request recs
   activate WebApp
   WebApp->>Recommender: Fetch Recommendations
   activate Recommender
   Recommender->>UserDatabase: Check User Interests
   activate UserDatabase
   UserDatabase-->>Recommender: Return User Interests([UserInterests])
   deactivate UserDatabase
   Recommender->>MuseumDatabase: Query Attractions by User Interest
   activate MuseumDatabase
   MuseumDatabase-->>Recommender: Return Matching Attractions ([Attractions])
   deactivate MuseumDatabase
   Recommender-->>WebApp: Return recommendations
   deactivate Recommender
   WebApp-->>User: Display recommendations to user
   deactivate WebApp
